00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.700
On the case on both sides of large AI data centers,

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.780
hundreds marched Saturday from Mount Pleasant to downtown,

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:50.780
Yahoo News Canada reports.

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.840
No AI Vancouver called it part of an international day of protest,

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:59.280
invited council candidates, and said the question is now a campaign issue.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:03.500
The application is a rezoning for a proposed data center in Mount Pleasant.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:08.900
In July, Vancouver City Council sent that file back to staff for more public consultation.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:14.000
That consultation does not start until after the October 17th municipal election.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:20.140
Torren Lerock, founder of No AI Vancouver, says the referral happened partly because hundreds

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.180
had signed up to speak.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:24.520
He wants voters to know which candidates are against AI.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:29.400
Cope candidate Leslie said the plan sits in a system that puts the ultra-wealthy ahead

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.300
of everyone else.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:33.760
Copes Yee Kirin said residents do not want the centers.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:39.480
Consultation has barely happened, and AI comes up at the door as often as housing and affordability.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:43.420
Both want a moratorium, and both say the city controls the zoning.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:50.620
Greens candidate Burns wants a moratorium until there is more regulation, but said she does not hear the worry often while door knocking.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.920
Bright Futures Lynn said the fight shows local government needs a broader change.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.680
The four candidates pointed to energy, water, and consultation.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:05.240
A 2024 International Energy Agency report cited in the story said data centers, largely driven

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:12.120
by AI, used roughly 1.5% of global energy, with demand projected to more than double by 2030,

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:16.720
and with that electricity used growing about four times faster than all other sectors.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:20.780
Burns and Yee Kirin disagree on how often people raise it at the door.

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:26.300
Council did not ban the project and did not approve it. The extra consultation both the

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:32.320
pause camp and that July order are waiting on is not set to start before October 17th.

